[FINAL-TEXT] **Root cause confirmed with direct evidence.** The cross-router paths are fully broken in both directions:
- `office_pc` → `it_hod` (192.168.1.2): `Destination Net Unreachable` from router1
- `office_pc` → `cs_hod` (192.168.2.2): 100% loss (silent drop, no route)
